Some (not all) of the answers you got may seem at bit snotty or
condescending. But they are right. Nethack is designed so you cannot
'undo' fatal mistakes or accidents -- they have to be planned against,
or compensated for.

So most games will end with your character getting killed.
Still, I'm sure everyone here recommend the game, warmly.

